window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Athena wakes up in hell.</p> <p>Well...it’s an alien slave ship, but it might as well be hell because she only has three choices.</p> <p>Mate. Become a sex slave. Or be killed.</p> <p>Great options.</p> <p>Desperate for freedom, a chance for survival is presented in the handsome rogue alien called Xul.</p> <p>But Xul is caught up in problems of his own and a mission he cannot afford to let fail - one that could be easily compromised if he dared open his heart.</p> <p>That doesn't leave her with many options and it doesn't help that she finds him utterly frustrating....</p> <p>....and strong, hot, irresistible....</p> <p>She shouldn’t really be thinking about him like that. Should she?</p> <p><i>Xul</i> is a stand-alone book that contains delightfully steamy scenes with a guaranteed happily-ever-after, possessive alpha males, and strong female leads. There is no forced mating between the hero and heroine and no cliffhanger. It is the first book in the Captured by Aliens sci-fi alien romance series. </p> <p>Buy <i>Xul</i> today! A new galaxy awaits.</p>"; 
